<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tissus du Mali — Boutique</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--paper:#F2EAD9;--ink:#241A12;--rust:#B5502A;--ochre:#C99A3E;--teal:#2C5F5A;--muted:#5B4E3E;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);}
.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px;}
.stripe{height:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--rust) 0 20px,var(--ochre) 20px 40px,var(--teal) 40px 60px);}
header{padding:22px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
.brand{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;}
nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:18px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;}
.hero{padding:50px 0 40px;}
h1{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(30px,6vw,48px);line-height:1.1;max-width:520px;}
h1 em{color:var(--rust);font-style:italic;}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);max-width:420px;margin-top:16px;font-size:14.5px;}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:24px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:13px 26px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;}
.grid{padding:40px 0;border-top:1px solid #D8C9A6;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;}
.tile{aspect-ratio:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:8px;}
footer{text-align:center;padding:34px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid #D8C9A6;}
@media(max-width:640px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stripe"></div>
<header><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;"><div class="brand">Tissus du Mali</div><nav><a href="#">Catalogue</a><a href="#">Commander</a></nav></div></header>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:24px;align-items:center;">
<div>
<h1>Le tissu qui <em>raconte</em> ton histoire.</h1>
<p>Bogolan, wax et bazin de qualité, sélectionnés directement auprès d'artisans maliens.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#">Voir le catalogue</a>
</div>
